SUMMARY:Watch: Optum Golf Channel Games
LOCATION:Trump National Golf Club Jupiter - Jupiter\, Florida\, USA
DESCRIPTION:Live primetime event coverage of Optum Golf Channel Games.\nTou
 r or organizer: Golf Channel / PGA TOUR Studios.\nWatch on: Golf Channel +
  USA Network.\nPublished time: Wednesday\, December 16\, 2026\, 7-11 p.m. 
 ET.\nTerritory: United States.\nRory McIlroy and Scottie Scheffler captain
  opposing four-player teams. Golf Channel lists pregame from 7–7:30 p.m.
 \, competition from 7:30–10:30 p.m.\, and postgame from 10:30–11 p.m. 
 Eastern.\nBroadcast details may change.\nOfficial source: https://thegolfc
 hannelgames.com/\nOfficial announcement: https://www.golfchannel.com/news/
 news/2026-optum-golf-channel-games-how-to-watch-teams-competition-lineup
